cher toy)\n715\t+              d (error #(lane-lower :register {:attach-stream attach!} wire attach!))]\n716\t+          (is (= [:yin.k/unsupported :continuation-registers] [(:yin.k/status d) (:yin.k/kind d)]) (pr-str d))\n717\t+          (is (path? (:yin.k/path d)) (pr-str (:yin.k/path d)))\n718\t+          (is (zero? @n) \"refused before any attachment\")\n719\t+          (testing \", the stack kernel holds it\"\n720\t+            (let [ref (reference (build identity))\n721\t+                  got (crossed :semantic-register :stack #(build identity))]\n722\t+              (is (= expected (:value ref)))\n723\t+              (is (= (:value ref) (:value got))))))))))\n724\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"47508f4a-f118-4fad-b5f9-49922c52f330","uuid":"634c800e-be62-4bbd-90a4-994a06eb14ea","timestamp":"2026-10-13T08:29:49.304Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sto/.claude/projects/-Users-sto-workspace-datomworld-docs-6c/47508f4a-f118-4fad-b5f9-49922c52f330/tool-results/by0a63njf.txt","content":"diff --git a/test/yin/vm/semantic_register/safepoint_harness_test.cljc b/test/yin/vm/semantic_register/safepoint_harness_test.cljc\nindex 735e6c85..4c393075 100644\n--- a/test/yin/vm/semantic_register/safepoint_harness_test.cljc\n+++ b/test/yin/vm/semantic_register/safepoint_harness_test.cljc\n@@ -10,7 +10,14 @@\n    trace equal the reference (law 1); the relift equals the lift by root\n    id under rows/canonical-under (law 2); the pending's reason is the\n    observed wait's (law 3); every lifted frame passes the validator\n-   (law 6). Row 20 runs once, outside the wrappers.\"\n+   (law 6). Row 20 runs once, outside the wrappers.\n+\n+   Phase 6c adds the two de Bruijn lanes (§5.3): a world built under\n+   *lane* :stack or :register runs A's derived image on that kernel and\n+   lifts and lowers through yin.vm.semantic-register.layout. Law 4 (one\n+   root id on all three lanes under canonical-under), law 5 (six ordered\n+   lowering pa